   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "We expect revenue and adjusted operating profit for the full year ending 31 March 2022 to be marginally ahead of our expectations, despite supply chain disruption and cost inflation.",
   "file": "20220413_OXIG_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-06-14",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "However, our diverse end-markets remain resilient, and we enter the year with good visibility due to a strong order book and continued order growth. This supports full year outlook in line with our expectations.",
